<title>UK: Bank of Nova Scotia sets $250 mln two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of Nova Scotia sets $250 mln two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1/16 PCT PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.955    FULL FEES   7.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.955</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    2.5 BP    SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
